<title>PERU: Peru's stock, financial mkts to close Thursday.</title>
<headline>Peru's stock, financial mkts to close Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Lima Stock Exchange and Peru's financial markets will be closed Thursday in observance of Labor Day.</p>
<p>The markets will reopen Friday.</p>
<p>((-- Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134))</p>
</text>
